OL,3,CWomen jailed after #50,000 company
OL,4,Ccard spending spree
OL,6,FA woman has been jailed after stealing
OL,7,F#50,000 from her employer - using it
OL,8,Fto buy holidays, clothes and takeaways.
OL,10,FDonna Pope, 47, used her company
OL,11,Fcredit card to fund the lavish
OL,12,Flifestyle, making personal purchases
OL,13,Fover several months including holidays
OL,14,Fto Amsterdam and Malaga, car
OL,15,Finsurance, phone bills, Amazon orders,
OL,16,Fand even her personal trainer.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
