FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785511095
OL,3,CWomen jailed after #50,000 company
OL,4,Ccard spending spree
OL,6,FShe also used the Ormskirk company's
OL,7,Fcard for shopping at Zara, Shein, and
OL,8,Fto buy herself new radiators at B&Q on
OL,9,Fthe same trip she was supposed to be
OL,10,Fbuying work supplies.
OL,12,FHer spending only came to light when
OL,13,Fher boss noticed unusual transactions
OL,14,Fon the company's bank statements and
OL,15,Fconfronted her.
OL,17,FPope, of Liverpool Road, Ormskirk,
OL,18,Fdenied any wrongdoing, claiming she
OL,19,Fhad mistakenly linked her personal
OL,20,FPayPal account to the business and
OL,21,Fwould "sort it out."
OL,26,@}D@GOU}D@TO]
