CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785511095
OL,3,CWomen jailed after #50,000 company
OL,4,Ccard spending spree
OL,6,FBut she went off sick before
OL,7,Feventually leaving the company
OL,8,Faltogether.
OL,10,FHer boss reported her to police, and
OL,11,Fshe was sentenced to 38 months in
OL,12,Fprison at Preston Crown Court after
OL,13,Fpleading guilty to fraud by abuse of
OL,14,Fposition.
OL,16,FIn a victim impact statement read to
OL,17,Fthe court her employer said: "When I
OL,18,Ffirst began to suspect irregularities,
OL,19,FDonna repeatedly denied any wrongdoing.
OL,26,@yD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
