CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785511095
OL,3,CWomen jailed after #50,000 company
OL,4,Ccard spending spree
OL,6,F"These explanations were lies. She
OL,7,Fcontinued to deny the fraud for many
OL,8,Fmonths and left the company, citing
OL,9,Fthat she was offered another job that
OL,10,Foffered more flexibility."
OL,12,FHe continued: "Her actions have
OL,13,Fdevastated my business, my finances,
OL,14,Fand my family's sense of security. The
OL,15,Femotional impact is ongoing.
OL,17,F"We are still dealing with the
OL,18,Fconsequences every day, and the road
OL,19,Fto recovery, financially, physically,
OL,20,Fand emotionally, remains uncertain."
OL,26,@tD@OOU|D@dO]
